window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"warwick","b":"locke","win":["Warwick","Warwick","Warwick","Warwick","Warwick","Warwick","Warwick"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Q Jaws of the Beast heals more than his poke deals, and his own W Soul Ignition drops him into the HP range where your passive and W Blood Hunt turn you into a heat-seeking missile."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"His R grounds - it shuts off dashes, so it denies your Q lunge and the Infinite Duress leap alike. Ult before the artifact lands, never into it."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your sustain outstats his one burst attempt; even a full combo leaves you healing back to full on the next wave while he has nothing left."},{"when":"Late","text":"Scaling heals plus suppress keep the duel yours forever - leap on him the moment he shows in a sidelane and eat him through the totem."}],"wants":{"you":["Q sustain trades that undo his poke for free","Blood Hunt speed the moment his W lowers him","R Infinite Duress through his totem window"],"foe":["Chip damage without ever dipping below half","E Ashen Pursuit resets to dodge your R leap","A totem placed before your suppress lands"]},"early":"You're ahead of Locke at every stage up to 6. Ritual Nails (10s) marks you from 950, but his autos have to reach you to cash in the marks, and Jaws of the Beast heals you more than he deals. Soul Ignition (18s) makes him faster, but it burns his own health, which Blood Hunt senses once he's under half. Ashen Pursuit (10s) is his only dash, so bite him after he's used it. Silver Stake adds damage as your health drops, so trade from high health. At 6 Infinite Duress suppresses him before Purgatory (120s) can execute you.","mid":"At 6 the order decides it: his R grounds, shutting off dashes, so it denies both Jaws of the Beast and the Infinite Duress leap while threatening an execute. Ult before the artifact lands, not after, and keep your health above his floor - a landed 1.5s suppress is still a kill he cannot answer.","late":"Items never save him - his single burst window loses to your Q healing and lifesteal, E Primal Howl's damage reduction blunts the W Soul Ignition combo, and your suppress still deletes his squishy frame on sight. Hunt him relentlessly in sidelanes; this matchup stays yours from minute one to the nexus.","whys":["Q Jaws of the Beast healing and innate lifesteal out-sustain his level-1 poke.","Your passive feasts on the low HP his own W creates - level-2 trades are free.","Jaws of the Beast sustain owns the level-3 all-in.","Your lifesteal keeps you ahead through levels 4-5.","Infinite Duress hard-counters his execute at 6 - you suppress him through the totem window.","Post-item your Q heal and lifesteal outstat his single burst.","Late, your scaling heals and R suppress outlast his whole kit."]});
